l_window.start_sec`, `temporal_window.start_sec + 0.5`, ...), without exceeding `temporal_window.end_sec`.\n- At each timestamp, output a tight bounding box for each role-bearing person as `[xmin, ymin, xmax, ymax]`, normalized to `[0,1000]`, with the origin at the top-left.\n\n## STRICT JSON SCHEMA\n\nReturn only the JSON object strictly in the format below:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"temporal_window\": {\n    \"start_sec\": number,\n    \"end_sec\": number\n  },\n  \"role_localization\": [\n    {\n      \"time_sec\": number,\n      \"offside_passer\": [xmin, ymin, xmax, ymax] or null,\n      \"offside_player\": [xmin, ymin, xmax, ymax] or null,\n      \"second_last_defender\": [xmin, ymin, xmax, ymax] or null\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```", "event_type": "offside", "active_roles": ["offside_passer", "offside_player", "second_last_defender"], "metadata": {"record_schema_version": 1, "sample_id": "england_epl/2014-2015/2015-02-21 - 18-00 Crystal Palace 1 - 2 Arsenal/Offside_H1_167221_w1", "game": "england_epl/2014-2015/2015-02-21 - 18-00 Crystal Palace 1 - 2 Arsenal", "half": 1, "event_type": "offside", "event_name": "Offside", "setting": "context_3min", "video_path": "soccerstvg/videos/context_3min/england_epl/2014-2015/2015-02-21 - 18-00 Crystal Palace 1 - 2 Arsenal/Offside_H1_167221_w1.mp4", "source_half_video": "external_data/SoccerNet/england_epl/2014-2015/2015-02-21 - 18-00 Crystal Palace 1 - 2 Arsenal/1_720p.mp4", "spatial_annotation_path": "soccerrole/spatial/annotations/england_epl/2014-2015/2015-02-21 - 18-00 Crystal Palace 1 - 2 Arsenal/Offside_H1_167221_w1_annotation.json", "spatial_annotation_sha256": "12ce8e8ffe1f4db8993c58e72ffd4c9885d94fc8d9961a234e599036e797ab9e", "stage2_event_type": "offside", "stage2_declared_roles": ["offside_passer", "offside_player", "second_last_defender"], "active_roles": ["offside_passer", "offside_player", "second_last_defender"], "predicate_role_structure": "offside_passer — pass — offside_player — offside — second_last_defender", "keyfram